OL,3,GNEWSARed route 'could make small
OL,4,Abusinesses go extinct'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness owners say they are concerned
OL,7,Fabout the impact of a proposed road
OL,8,Fscheme which would ban drivers from
OL,9,Fstopping at any time.
OL,11,FLucie Wise, owner of printing business
OL,12,FMinuteman Press in the Bedminster area
OL,13,Fof Bristol, said the proposed red route
OL,14,Fwould "restrict" deliveries, customers
OL,15,Fand make it harder for those wishing to
OL,16,Fcollect heavy goods.
OL,18,FIf approved, the restrictions would see
OL,19,Fthe introduction of double red lines to
OL,20,Fprohibit vehicles from parking, loading
OL,21,For unloading.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
