OL,3,GNEWSARed route 'could make small
OL,4,Abusinesses go extinct'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBristol City Council, which said the
OL,7,Fscheme would reduce congestion and
OL,8,Fimprove public transport, said it would
OL,9,Fconsult and work with businesses while
OL,10,Fworking to improve the transport system
OL,11,Ffor everyone.
